---
import GenericLayout from '@layouts/GenericLayout.astro';
import Heading from '@components/Heading.astro';
import ArticleImage from '@components/ArticleImage.astro';

import JackOLantern from '@assets/about/community/jack-o-lantern.jpeg';
import WelcomeEvent from '@assets/about/community/welcome-event.jpg';
import MeetingImg from '@assets/about/community/meeting.jpg';
import Asobi from '@assets/about/community/enoshima.jpg';

const title = "Community Team";
const description =
  "The Community Team is one of the five teams that make up TPG. This team plans a wide variety of events with the goal of fostering communities within Taki Plaza, constantly taking on new challenges through diverse activities.";
---
<GenericLayout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  ListItem={[
    { name: 'About TPG', path: 'about' },
    { name: 'Community Team', path: 'community' },
  ]}
>
  <Heading title="Our Activities">
    The Community Team aims to create opportunities for people to connect with one another.
    We plan workshops and events that allow students to meet new people and form new communities.
    <br />
    For example, in the second quarter of the previous academic year, we held an international
    exchange event called <strong>“Summer Wagashi Workshop”</strong>, where international and Japanese
    students could interact while making traditional Japanese sweets.
    Participants made seasonal sweets such as <em>Minazuki</em> and <em>Kohakuto</em>,
    and the event was enjoyed by many students.
    <br />
    In addition, during the welcome period this academic year, we organized a
    <strong>New Student Exchange Event</strong> to help first-year students get to know one another
    and encourage the formation of new communities.
    Over two days, more than 300 new students participated and deepened their connections
    through various games and activities.
    <ArticleImage src={WelcomeEvent} alt="New Student Exchange Event" caption="New Student Exchange Event" />
    <ArticleImage src={JackOLantern} alt="Jack-o’-lantern" caption="Let’s Make a Jack-o’-Lantern!" />
  </Heading>

  <Heading title="Social Activities">
    The Community Team is made up of many free-spirited members.
    While we do not organize social outings very frequently, we often go out for meals together
    after events to strengthen our connections.
    We also hold social gatherings several times a year—going to places like Enoshima,
    Joypolis, or renting spaces for casual get-togethers.
    In fact, we might be having more fun than it seems!
    <ArticleImage src={Asobi} alt="Social activities" />
    <ArticleImage src={MeetingImg} alt="Regular meeting" />
  </Heading>
</GenericLayout>

